</mxCell><mxCell id="s_13" value="• &lt;b&gt;Tabel users:&lt;/b&gt; Akun pengguna sistem&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tabel app_roles &amp;amp; role_permissions:&lt;/b&gt; Konfigurasi RBAC&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tabel telegram_users:&lt;/b&gt; Pendaftaran akun Bot Telegram&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tabel activity_logs:&lt;/b&gt; Audit trail sistem" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9.5;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="330" y="1565" width="330" height="92" as="geometry" />
</mxCell><mxCell id="st1_13" value="&lt;b&gt;Manajemen User (/users) &amp;amp; Hak Akses (/roles) &amp;rarr;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Buat akun baru, reset password bcrypt, tautkan ke NIP karyawan&lt;br/&gt;• Atur hak akses tiap role dengan checklist perizinan modul" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9.5;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
