</mxCell><mxCell id="st2_13" value="&lt;b&gt;Approval Bot Telegram &amp;amp; Konversi Data &amp;rarr;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Buka &lt;code&gt;/settings/telegram-users&lt;/code&gt; &amp;rarr; Klik &#x27;Approve&#x27; akun operator&lt;br/&gt;• Fasilitas upload/migrasi file Excel di &lt;code&gt;/settings/konversi-data/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Audit trail di &lt;code&gt;/log-aktivitas&lt;/code&gt; &amp;amp; Dashboard Umum (&lt;code&gt;/dashboard&lt;/code&gt;)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9.5;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
